<body>
<p>Dear ${managername},</p>
Please be advised that ${creator} has submitted a Payslip to ${employee} for your attention on ${date}
Click here to view the Payslip where you can approve or reject it.
<p>Click <a href="${url}" title="View payslip">here</a>  to view the Payslip where you can approve or reject it.</p>
Once you approve or reject the Payslip ${employee} will receive email notification about its status.
<p>Your Sincerely,</p>
<p>${creator}</p>
<p>${companyname}</p>